@startuml
title OldShop — JSON sản phẩm hiện tại
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
class Document <<object>> {
  _id: str {required}
  schema_version: Literal[1] = 1
  deleted: bool = False
}
class ProductDetails <<document>> {
  product_id: Identifier {required}
  category_id: Identifier {required}
  description: str | None = None
  video_url: str | None = None
  weight_grams: Annotated[int, Field(ge=0)] | None = None
  dimensions: Dimensions | None = None
  dimensions_raw: str | None = None
  condition: Condition | None = None
  attributes: dict[str, JsonValue] = {}
  tags: list[str] = []
  images: list[ProductImageReference] = []
  updated_at: AwareDatetime {required}
  deleted: bool = False
  etl: ETLMetadata | None = None
}
class Dimensions <<object>> {
  length: float {required}
  width: float {required}
  height: float {required}
  unit: Literal['cm', 'mm', 'm'] = 'cm'
}
class Condition <<object>> {
  grade: int {required}
  warranty_months: int = 0
  defects: list[str] = []
}
class ObjectReference <<object>> {
  bucket: str {required}
  key: str {required}
  content_type: str | None = None
  size: Annotated[int, Field(ge=0)] | None = None
}
class ProductImageReference <<object>> {
  image_id: Identifier | None = None
  is_primary: bool = False
  display_order: int = 0
}
class ETLMetadata <<object>> {
  synced_at: AwareDatetime {required}
  source_updated_at: AwareDatetime | None = None
  run_id: str | None = None
  source_created_at: str | None = None
}
class ProductResponse <<API DTO>> {
  … core fields abbreviated
  product_images: list[ProductImageResponse]
}
class ProductDetailResponse <<API DTO>> {
  seller: UserResponse | None = None
  reviews: list[ProductReviewResponse] = []
  attributes: dict[str, JsonValue] = {}
  tags: list[str] = []
  metadata_status: Literal['available', 'missing', 'unavailable'] = 'missing'
  metadata_synced_at: datetime | None = None
}
Document <|-- ProductDetails
ObjectReference <|-- ProductImageReference
ProductDetails "1" *--> "0..1" Dimensions : dimensions
ProductDetails "1" *--> "0..1" Condition : condition
ProductDetails "1" *--> "0..*" ProductImageReference : images
ProductDetails "1" *--> "0..1" ETLMetadata : etl
ProductResponse <|-- ProductDetailResponse
ProductDetails ..> ProductDetailResponse : metadata service: attributes/tags/sync
note as Legend
Document fields follow documents.py; API core is abbreviated.
Composition describes embedded value objects, not database FK or separate collections.
Required/default/null follow model. Defaults are applied by application model, not Mongo validator.
Document uses BSON dates; JSON transport uses ISO 8601.
end note
@enduml
